{"candidate_identity":"7406153a1c552872d87e7328d544111893f80dd8b332947eaa6117c4d724c9f1","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c04d83110764067608ff62bf11f55c4cb84c5b17bcb9025e741685d73b8e6cfc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0a9771b2cae1ade492508c65a38fc08c87808919ba62bcbfbba0857a1721adb1","logical_entry_identity":"518359e7cf47b9a20849eb986bde51a2ff7a2abd152c91a169488a6e9f1a83a2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your body has become a mass of living corruption, increasing your blight and acid resistance by %d%% and blight affinity by %d%%.\nOn taking damage greater than 15%% of your maximum health, the damage will be reduced by %d%% and a carrion worm mass will burst forth onto a nearby tile, attacking your foes for 5 turns.\nYou can never have more than 5 worms active from any source at a time.\nWhen a carrion worm dies it will explode into a radius 2 pool of blight for 5 turns, dealing %0.2f blight damage each turn and healing you for 33%% of that amount.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的身体已经腐败，增加 %d%% 枯萎和酸性抗性，%d%% 枯萎伤害亲和。\n\t\t每当你受到大于最大生命值 15%% 的伤害时，该伤害将减少 %d%%，同时在相邻的格子生成一团腐尸蠕虫，攻击你的敌人 5 回合。\n\t\t无论来源为何，你同时最多只能拥有 5 只蠕虫。\n\t\t蠕虫死亡时将爆炸，产生半径 2 的枯萎毒池，持续 5 回合，每回合造成 %0.2f 枯萎伤害，并按该伤害的 33%% 治疗你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"df050df3bb84507668c61224008d4fa30d50ad5ff87b4f38954aa237810c024e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f99321a01a2cbf805feb33c1eac20e098fa8140e98f59a98668626f0f4cfb75","logical_entry_identity":"04cc754ea8367d4abe397a9386d63138823a14e778f1e72d4e88b5259d4b5181","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"bloody shield","source_tag":"_t","target":"血迹斑斑的盾牌"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ac15e045abf4a03140b9e1cf29c5a2878fa6e06ce9d8649eaa466b36f8364bc0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0fa763aedae31fad3ea7f892cf9f1e14cea9b08ddd11c39f0b882bf9d26d7636","logical_entry_identity":"aaace53797169ca7f5b5cd4c53148aea8d28db579eabc4db74837d4c02cd